{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cdeps_datm_jra",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the CDEPS DATM data-atmosphere component for the JRA55 v1.5 forcing with the JRA datamode (cdeps1.0.112, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-cdeps branch instrument/cdeps-dumps): the stream time-interpolation laws of shr_strdata_advance (streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90:1292-1391) and the forcing-derivation laws of datm_datamode_jra_advance (datm/datm_datamode_jra_mod.F90:271-322), with the shared pointwise laws imported from ./cdeps_templates.esm. Three models: (1) Streams - the per-field time interpolation value = flb*lb + fub*ub (0 at night for the coszen streams), the identical law to the CLMNCEP Streams model of cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm but applied here via the factored stream_interp template; (2) Jra - the JRA55 datamode: the exports are direct copies of the stream values (Sa_pslv = Sa_pbot = strm_pslv, Sa_tbot = Sa_ptem = strm_tbot, Sa_u/Sa_v = strm_u/strm_v, Sa_shum = strm_shum - no qsat cap in this datamode, the humidity passes through), Sa_z = 10 m, Sa_u10m/v10m = Sa_u/Sa_v, Sa_dens = pbot/(rdair*tbot*(1+0.608*shum)) with the moisture coefficient 0.608 an UNSUFFIXED single-precision literal (the law uses r4(0.608) = 0.6079999804496765, see bugs.md), the precip split as a step at tbot = TKFRZ (or the prrn/prsn stream passthrough when the streams separate rain and snow), the LY08 albedo avg_alb = 0.069 - 0.011*cos(2*lat*degtorad) with the 0.069/0.011 coefficients likewise UNSUFFIXED single-precision literals (the law uses r4(0.069)/r4(0.011), see bugs.md) with Faxa_swnet = swdn*(1 - avg_alb), and the fixed swdn split 0.28/0.31/0.24/0.17; (3) JRAFiles - the netcdf reader path into the JRA55 v1.5 daily TL319 files (2920 records/yr, model year 1 aligned to data year 1958 as in the C_JRA_t62 case: taxmode = cycle, year_align = 1). The traced-row tests pin the stage-1 dumps of the C_JRA_t62_datm_inst run (datm_jra_streams.csv, datm_jra_exports.csv, cdeps_strdata_streams_jra.csv in stage1/dumps/cdeps/).",
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "JRA55 datamode of the CDEPS data-atmosphere component, ESCOMP/CDEPS cdeps1.0.112, datm/datm_datamode_jra_mod.F90 (the source of the pinned laws)."
   }
  ]
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_REC": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 0,
   "description": "Number of time records the netcdf reader delivers for each JRA55 source (bound by the source's extent at test time; 0 so the document validates standalone). Each JRA.v1.5.*.TL319.1958.210504.nc file carries 2920 daily records."
  }
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "record": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_REC"
  }
 },
 "data_sources": {
  "JRA_prec": {
