     "description": "Synthetic equatorial row: avg_alb = r4(0.069) - r4(0.011)*cos(0) = 0.057999998331069946, Faxa_swnet = 300*(1 - avg_alb) = 282.600000500679 (datm_datamode_jra_mod.F90:317-318 with the UNSUFFIXED single-precision literals 0.069/0.011, see bugs.md; the LY08 albedo ranges 0.058 at the equator to 0.08 at the poles for the exact r8 coefficients).",
